Package: bookshelfng
Version: __DEB_VERSION__
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ChaptarrNG maintainers <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/snapetech-org/chaptarrng
Depends: ca-certificates, libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libicu70 | libicu74 | libicu76, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libsqlite3-0, util-linux, zlib1g
Recommends: ffmpeg
Provides: chaptarrng
Conflicts: chaptarrng
Description: BookshelfNG package identity carrying the ChaptarrNG application
 Keeps the existing BookshelfNG package name, service, environment file, and
 data directory while installing ChaptarrNG. Supported BookshelfNG SQLite data
 is migrated on startup and retained in a source database backup.
